    <briefdescription>
<para>Utility class providing random number generation functionalities. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class maintains a shared Mersenne Twister random number generator for reproducible and thread-safe random generation. It supports generation of doubles, integers, time steps, indices, and various operations like shuffling or sampling unique elements.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>All methods are static, meaning the class is used as a pure utility. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
